      "template": "lléveme a [Loc], por favor",
      "tags": "topic:taxi",
      "cue_en": "Politely tell the taxi driver (formal usted) to take you to the hotel. Which is correct?",
      "options": [
        {"text": "Lléveme al hotel, por favor.", "correct": true},
        {"text": "Llévame al hotel, por favor.", "correct": false},
        {"text": "Lléveme a el hotel, por favor.", "correct": false}
      ],
      "constraint_note": "Formal usted imperative is lleve (not tú llévame), and a + el always contracts to al."
